          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Electric fireplace</td>
            <td>Ambience and supplementary room heating</td>
            <td>Visual effect with integrated heat</td>
            <td>Appearance may be the main feature</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Electric blanket or heated throw</td>
            <td>Bed or individual warmth</td>
            <td>Warms a person rather than the whole room</td>
            <td>Must be used and stored correctly</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Reverse-cycle air conditioner</td>
